# .claude/gate: the files only the main session edits. Read by
# .claude/hooks/gate-guard.py, which refuses a subagent's Edit/Write on any
# of them. One path or pattern per line, relative to the repo root; a path
# covers everything under it; `*` matches across `/`. `#` starts a comment.
# `.claude/`, `CLAUDE.md` and `LEDGER.md` are protected without being listed.
scripts/                 # check-dist.mjs, check-php.sh: the checks themselves
package.json             # the build command and the dependency set
package-lock.json
astro.config.mjs
src/content.config.ts    # the project/devlog frontmatter schema the build validates against
.github/workflows/       # deploy.yml: what a push to main does to production
deploy.sh
deploy-play.sh
static/files/            # resume PDFs, written only by the Resume-with-Tex CI
